  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x2B7" flags="0x0">
    <title>DZWOLA @ 0x1CA397</title>
    <description>Lambda correction of ignition, used twice: in the optimum-ignition model (zwopt) and in the basic ignition zwgru as dzwol (RAM 0x80469D). CONFIRMED 2026-11-18 together with KFDZWKG: code 0x0AE8B4 reads it with lambas (RAM 0x804537) and stores dzwol; zwgru adds it at 0x0A86FC. Stock: -3.0 deg at lambda 0.80-0.85, so at full load it partly cancels KFDZWKG. Axis lambda (x/128), values x0.75 deg.</description>
