  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x3F7" flags="0x0">
    <title>FKKVS @ 0x1D2586</title>
    <description>Fuel system correction factor on injection time (Bosch: factor to correct fuel delivery system). CONFIRMED IN CODE 2026-11-18: 0x12F134 reads it with nmot_w and the uncorrected injection time; result ftek_w (RAM 0x7FADAC) multiplies tef (0x114210-0x114228). Rows rpm, columns injection time ms. Stock: about 1.00 at 1-5 ms, rising to 1.10 at 16 ms and above, so every full-load injection (18-22 ms) gets +10 percent here. Log fit with the injector constant and the pressure curve: fuel model consistent within about 2 percent from 30 to 170 percent load.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="8" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0">
