    <title>TVUBAT @ 0x1D27D2</title>
    <description>Injector dead time vs battery voltage (added on top of tef_w, which excludes it). Stock 1.85 ms at 8 V, 1.22 at 10 V, 0.88 at 12 V, 0.65 at 14 V, 0.48 at 16 V. Output tvub_w (RAM 0x803DE4). Name, address and scaling from the Ford A2L port; voltage axis x0.0942 V matches the logged ub scaling. True injector duty = (tef_w + dead time) x rpm / 1200: about 3 points above the tef-only figure at full load.</description>
