    <description>RICH-MIXTURE IGNITION ADVANCE (Bosch: ignition angle correction due to knock limit shift). CONFIRMED 2026-11-18. Code: 0x147828 reads it with nmot (8-bit) and lambas (basic lambda, RAM 0x804537) and stores dzwkg (RAM 0x804596); zwgru = cam-weighted KFZW/KFZW2/KFZWA/KFZWA2 + dzwoag (forced 0) + dzwol (DZWOLA) + dzwkg (code 0x0A86EC-0x0A873C). Logs (4 logs, 99 knock-free full-load rows, 2500-5000 rpm, lambda 0.80-0.88): fired timing = KFZW + KFDZWKG + DZWOLA within -0.1 deg median, 1.05 deg mean absolute. Net effect at lambda 0.82: about +1.7 deg at 3000 rpm, +2.4 at 4000, +2.9 at 5500. Rows rpm, columns basic lambda. Richer LAMFA automatically adds timing through this map.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="3" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedaddress="0x1D31C9" mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="0" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
